{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore. Listen. Observe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIMINAL WATERS is a liminal spacewalking simulator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large pool complex with various rooms and themes and be enchanted by the radiant beauty of Unreal Engine 5.6. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developer's handcrafted soundtrack provides relaxation or anxiety depending on your location. No monsters or cheap jump scares tho! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, feelings of unease, confusion, and confinement may arise. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle events and sophisticated sound design immerse the player in the game world \u2013 there is no interface or mission objectives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The focus is on exploring the detailed and beautifully lit levels and finding the exit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Waters requires modern hardware, at least 8gb Vram. Laptop devices may not be supported!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game is not designed to run on Steam Deck.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has controller support, so sit back and enjoy your trip into the strange and mysterious pool rooms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You get:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric Exploration Experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 2 Hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted Environments and Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Graphics featuring the latest Unreal Engine 5 tech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No maze like levels. Straight forward level design that doesn't waste your time by looping the player around.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015300?t=1761651179","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015300?t=1761651179","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015300/721a8e44aed0b7f5036c4361eea193755b9a418d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761651179","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015300/721a8e44aed0b7f5036c4361eea193755b9a418d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761651179","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore. Listen. Observe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIMINAL WATERS is a liminal spacewalking simulator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large pool complex with various rooms and themes and be enchanted by the radiant beauty of Unreal Engine 5.6. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developer's handcrafted soundtrack provides relaxation or anxiety depending on your location. No monsters or cheap jump scares tho! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, feelings of unease, confusion, and confinement may arise. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle events and sophisticated sound design immerse the player in the game world \u2013 there is no interface or mission objectives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The focus is on exploring the detailed and beautifully lit levels and finding the exit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Waters requires modern hardware, at least 8gb Vram. Laptop devices may not be supported!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game is not designed to run on Steam Deck.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 